Iya, ayo.

00:24:29.766 --> 00:24:30.800
Jangan di-nun-nun.

00:25:24.766 --> 00:25:26.133
Sakit.

00:26:40.933 --> 00:26:42.433
Sakit.

00:27:18.233 --> 00:27:21.033
Enak.

00:27:44.133 --> 00:27:46.400
Sakit. Sakit.

