01:03:45.633 --> 01:03:46.633
Tangannya juga...

01:04:09.900 --> 01:04:11.533
Sedikit geser ke kanan.

01:04:54.700 --> 01:04:56.000
Manis banget.

01:05:39.300 --> 01:05:43.700
